      "title": "Data",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "The last day of usage in this load, and the day it was loaded. Amber when the data is more than 2 days old (n360.settings stamp_stale_days): the numbers are the last good night's. Click for Pipeline health.\n\n**Source:** n360.v_freshness (n360.runs: loaded runs only)  \n**Filter:** none  \n**Window:** the latest load",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT concat(stamp, if(stale, concat(' \u00b7 ', toString(days_old), ' days old'), '')) AS stamp FROM n360.v_freshness",
