      "description": "Support tickets still open for these customers. The v2 tile counts P1 tickets; priority is not in the export yet, so every open ticket is counted. Phase 2 (proposed design, tested on synthetic only): field meanings are open questions in docs/08_DECISIONS.md. Empty until the company export carries these files.\n\n**Source:** n360.ps_ticket  \n**Filter:** CSM  \n**Window:** all tickets",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
